# Public scheduling page for "Book a free call" and "Request an app audit".
# When this is an http(s) link, both buttons open it in a new tab.
# When it is empty, "Book a free call" emails with the subject "Free call",
# and "Request an app audit" emails with the subject "App audit".
# Google Calendar appointment schedule or Cal.com both work. Paste the page URL only.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BOOKING_URL=https://cal.com/your-name/intro
